                    "To build a lamp, purchase a lamp kit and find a sturdy base that can stand on its own, such as a log, wine bottle, or hollowed out book. Cut or drill a hole through your base large enough to hold the lamp rod, then use rubber stoppers to make sure it’s stable. Thread your lamp cord through the rod and put it into the base. Check that the cords are fully threaded, then screw the lock nut onto the lamp rod, followed by the harp bottom and socket cap. To learn how to strip your wires and attach them to the bulb socket, scroll down!",
