            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "{{Pictures|date=2013-03-08}}{{fa}}Got an odd piece that you want to display, but aren't sure what to do with it? How about making a lamp? You can make lamps out of almost anything, and they make great conversation pieces.  Here's how to do it.",
                    "#Thread the cord through the rod.  The cord should consist of two covered wires stuck together.  Thread it through the rod from bottom to top, leaving 3 or 4 inches (7 to 10 cm) of cord about the base."
                ],
                "removed": [
